| `unenforced-hint` | `rg -c '\[[A-Za-z][^]\[]{2,}\]' $S/templates/core/*.tmpl` | 003 |
| `doc-code-mismatch` | `rg -n '\[PLACEHOLDER\]' $S/references` and any reference sentence that names a rule `validate.sh` does not run | 003 |

