specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/005-weak-model-authoring-card/spec.md:3:description: "A weak model is told to follow a 1,200-line template guide and does not. This phase gives it one short card, routes the four authoring intents to that card, and guards the card, the router and the inventory against drift."
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/005-weak-model-authoring-card/spec.md:12:<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core + level2-verify + level3-arch | v2.2 -->
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/005-weak-model-authoring-card/spec.md:22:This phase writes one short authoring card and makes the skill's router load it for the four authoring intents. The long template guide stays reachable on request. A sync guard and a vocabulary test keep the card, the router, the inventory and the authoring checklist in step.
