specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/002-template-and-example-defect-repair/tasks.md:264:- [ ] T008 Delete the dead hash file (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/.hashes`). The file lists four template files, three of which are not there, and nothing reads it. Run the guard block first. It searches `.skilled` and then the whole repository root for the text `.hashes`, and it saves each list of readers. Verify: it prints `rc=1` twice. The code `1` means ripgrep found no reader. The code `0` means it found a reader and the list is in the saved file. The code `2` means the search itself failed. Only when both codes are `1`, run the delete block. For any other code, do not delete. Mark this task `[B]`, and write the code and the saved list in `goal.md` section 4. Last check after the delete: `test ! -e $S/templates/.hashes && echo DELETED` prints `DELETED`.
