specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:53:**Scope Boundary**: Edits land in `templates/core`, `templates/addons`, `templates/examples`, and three new files under `runtime/cli`. This phase does not edit the router, the references, the commands or the playbooks. Phase 005 owns the card and phase 007 owns the docs.
