specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:70:<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-context -->
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:74:<!-- ANCHOR:problem -->
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:78:A fresh Level 2 scaffold holds 97 bracketed hints and validates clean. A weak model leaves many of them in place, or replaces them with a sentence that restates the heading. The template says what field to fill but never what a good answer looks like. The 21 hand-written examples that a model imitates carry 14 anchor drifts and 18 leaked descriptions, so the model copies a skeleton the validator no longer expects.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:81:Every section tells a weak model the one action to take and shows one good and one weak answer. The examples match the templates again, and two commands fail when either property breaks.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:82:<!-- /ANCHOR:problem -->
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:86:<!-- ANCHOR:scope -->
