specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:89:### In Scope
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:90:- One `<!-- FILL: ... -->` line below every `## ` heading in the four core templates.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:91:- One fill line below every `## ` heading in the ten addon templates.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:92:- Seven anchor repairs, four in `spec.md.tmpl` and three in `research.md.tmpl`.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:93:- Anchor alignment in 14 example documents. Content stays.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:94:- A read-only example drift guard and its vitest wrapper.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:95:- A fill-guidance test that holds the anchor count per level and document.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:98:### Out of Scope
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:102:- Any change to the verdict for an existing packet. The gate stays version-stamped.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:103:- Any change to `packet-types`. Those templates serve research and review packets and are not core section templates.
