specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:251:### US-002: A guard that catches example drift (Priority: P0)
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:253:**As a** maintainer, **I want** one read-only command that names every example whose anchors differ from its template, **so that** a template edit cannot silently leave the examples stale.
