specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/002-template-and-example-defect-repair/spec.md:13:# Feature Specification: Phase 2: template-and-example-defect-repair
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/002-template-and-example-defect-repair/spec.md:22:This phase applies every ledger row whose `owner_phase` is `002`. Twenty-five rows are known now and written out literally in `tasks.md`. The rest come from the phase 1 census and were checked by the phase 1 frontier review. Exact text swaps are applied by a tested script, not by a model, so a weak executor cannot paraphrase them.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/002-template-and-example-defect-repair/spec.md:24:**Key Decisions**: exact-match rows are applied by `apply_row.py`, which refuses unless the old text occurs exactly once. The dead `templates/.hashes` file is deleted. Write-recipe rows go to `041-write-recipe-fixes/006-fix-write-recipe-move-destination`.
