.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/handlers/save/README.md:93:| `spec-folder-mutex.ts` | Serializes work per spec folder. `withSpecFolderLock()` chains in-process callers through the `SPEC_FOLDER_LOCKS` map; the interprocess helpers create, refresh, reclaim and release lock directories under a dedicated save-lock root inside the OS temp directory, resolved by `getLockDir()`. Also exports `getLockOwnerState`, `LOCK_STALE_MS` and `LOCK_HEARTBEAT_MS` for targeted lock-liveness tests; those are not part of the save-flow API. |
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/handlers/save/README.md:103:| Concurrency | A writer that mutates a spec folder runs inside `withSpecFolderLock()` before it touches the filesystem. |
