.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/EXTENSION-GUIDE.md:61:Template versions live in `spec-kit-docs.json.versions[<template basename>]`.
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/EXTENSION-GUIDE.md:78:`levels.<level>.sectionGates` is a per-document anchor profile. Keep legacy flat keys only when compatibility requires it; new anchors belong under the document basename.
