.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/workflows/auto-mode-contract.md:17:This reference module defines the single canonical `:auto` setup-resolution contract used by every user-invokable `/command:*:auto` surface in spec-kit (`/spec_kit:*`, `/create:*`, `/deep:*`). Each command's §0 cites this contract and supplies only its own per-field Default Resolution Table + `PRE-BOUND SETUP ANSWERS:` field list. The contract semantics, marker grammar, error format, and verification protocol live here.
