specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/002-template-and-example-defect-repair/spec.md:213:**As a** weak model copying an example, **I want** every description to be a finished sentence, **so that** the doc I write does not inherit a broken one.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:3:description: "Every core template section gets one imperative fill instruction and a good and a weak example, the addon sections get an instruction, the hand-written examples are aligned, and a golden render test plus a drift guard hold the result."
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:8:  - "example drift guard"
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:22:Phase 003 turns every core hint into a value token. A token still does not tell a weak model what to write. This phase puts one imperative instruction below every section heading, with a good and a weak example, so the model copies a standard instead of inventing one. It also aligns the 14 drifted examples a model imitates and adds two guards so the guidance cannot rot.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:24:**Key Decisions**: the guidance is an HTML comment below the heading, and the example drift guard delegates anchor comparison to the template contract.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:26:**Critical Dependencies**: phase 002 must be closed, because it repairs the 18 leaked example descriptions and the drift guard's description rules pass only on that tree. Phase 003 must be closed, because every locator is written in both the pre-token and post-token form.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:53:**Scope Boundary**: Edits land in `templates/core`, `templates/addons`, `templates/examples`, and three new files under `runtime/cli`. This phase does not edit the router, the references, the commands or the playbooks. Phase 005 owns the card and phase 007 owns the docs.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:56:- Phase 002 is closed and its 18 example description repairs are in place, because the drift guard expects a usable description in every example.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:63:- Aligned anchors in 14 example documents.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:64:- `runtime/cli/spec/check-example-drift.sh` and its vitest wrapper.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:78:A fresh Level 2 scaffold holds 97 bracketed hints and validates clean. A weak model leaves many of them in place, or replaces them with a sentence that restates the heading. The template says what field to fill but never what a good answer looks like. The 21 hand-written examples that a model imitates carry 14 anchor drifts and 18 leaked descriptions, so the model copies a skeleton the validator no longer expects.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:81:Every section tells a weak model the one action to take and shows one good and one weak answer. The examples match the templates again, and two commands fail when either property breaks.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:93:- Anchor alignment in 14 example documents. Content stays.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/spec.md:94:- A read-only example drift guard and its vitest wrapper.
